  VALUES ('CORE', 2, 'Preferences model: category × channel, locked categories, quiet hours, tenant defaults', 'Users can''t choose how they are notified. `app_config.notification_defaults` exists but nothing uses it.', '* New migration: a `notification_preference` table `(identity_id, category, channel, enabled)` plus quiet hours (default 21:00–07:00) and time zone per identity.
