  VALUES ('CORE', 3, 'Scheduler + delivery worker: Cloud Scheduler tick, escalation, retention', 'There is no server-side clock. Reminders, deferred deliveries, escalation and digests can''t happen.', '* Add an internal `POST /api/v1/internal/jobs/notifications/tick`, guarded by `requireInternalJobSecret`. It iterates tenants.
* Each tick:
  * sends due pending deliveries (with retry and backoff);
  * escalates important notifications unread in-app for 30 min to email;
  * runs time-based producers (reminders and the digest, from later tickets);
  * purges read items after 90 days, unread after 180 days, and the delivery log after 1 year.
* Idempotent and safe to overlap, using a row lock / `SKIP LOCKED`.
* Add a Google Cloud Scheduler job every 5 min for dev and prod (runbook in docs).',
    '* Tests show the tick is idempotent, escalation fires once at 30 min and not when already read, and the purge honours all 3 windows.
* The Scheduler job is live on dev and the logs show ticks.', 'backlog', 2, ARRAY['Notifications', 'Feature']::text[],
    '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-3', 'linear',
    '2026-09-27T01:06:06.994Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-27T01:06:06.994Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-27T01:06:06.994Z'::timestamptz, NULL)
