Demo minimum scope for the worker: move the existing bell from the admin-only DashboardView into the global top app bar for **all roles** (admin, manager, doctor, rep), desktop + phone, with unread count, mark read, and a click that deep-links to the record. Grouping per record and the app-icon Badging API are nice-to-have — ship the minimum first if time is short.
Must merge before code freeze 2026-10-05. Pairs with the three in-app event tickets (sub-issues of NEO-141).', 'linear', 'import', '2026-09-29T23:41:23.574Z'::timestamptz FROM ins
