  VALUES ('CORE', 5, 'Web push end to end: service worker, contextual permission, actions, generic lock-screen text', 'Push is half-built:

* `routes/push.ts` has no `requireAuth` and no `withTenant`;
* the service worker has no `push` / `notificationclick` handler;
* the app never asks for permission;
* nothing calls `sendPushToUser`.', '* Fix the subscribe/unsubscribe routes: authenticated, tenant-scoped, keyed by identity.
* Add a push channel adapter in the worker (VAPID). Drop expired subscriptions on a 404/410 response.
* Service worker: show the generic text from the catalog (no PHI on the lock screen), add Open and Confirm actions, and on click focus/open the deep link.
* Ask for permission in context after the first meaningful action (e.g. booking an appointment), never on load. Offer a retry from preferences.
* iOS: push only for the installed PWA ([NEO-87](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-87/pwa-installable-fix-missing-manifest-icons-install-app-button-next-to)). Otherwise show a hint.',
    '* A doctor on Android, desktop Chrome and installed iOS gets a push for an appointment booking.
* A tap opens the appointment.
* No patient name appears in the payload (test).
* Unsubscribed or expired endpoints are cleaned up.', 'backlog', 2, ARRAY['Notifications', 'Feature']::text[],
    '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-5', 'linear',
    '2026-09-27T01:06:20.556Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-27T01:06:20.556Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-27T01:06:20.556Z'::timestamptz, NULL)
