* Morning digest: on/off and time (default 07:00 on weekdays).
* Admin tab: tenant defaults for the same matrix.
* On phone, show one row per category with chips, no horizontal scroll.',
    '* A doctor can turn off email for appointments, and a test confirms no email is sent.
* Locks can''t be toggled.
* Quiet hours are saved.
* e2e runs on desktop and phone.
* Screenshots are attached.', 'backlog', 3, ARRAY['Notifications', 'Feature']::text[],
