  VALUES ('CORE', 10, 'Security events: new-device login, password changed (locked, bypass quiet hours)', 'Users are not told when their account signs in from a new device or when their password changes. ISO 27001 and SOC 2 expect this, and it''s standard practice.', '* Add a `security` category, locked (ADR-012): it can''t be disabled and it ignores quiet hours.
