  VALUES ('CORE', 11, 'Morning digest "Your day": 07:00 weekdays, editable, only when non-empty', 'Doctors and managers prefer one morning summary over many single emails.', '* Once a day at the user''s digest time (default 07:00, Mon–Fri, local time zone), send one email with:
