  VALUES ('CORE', 16, 'Manual "urgent" flag on a result, set by a person (no automatic clinical triage)', 'A severe result lands in the inbox like any other. Automatic thresholds (e.g. AHI > 30) would make the app a medical device (SaMD, MDR IIa), so r2/R1 rejected them for now.', '* Whoever uploads or sends a result (a technician or coordinator) can mark it "urgent" and add a short reason.
