  VALUES ('CORE', 20, 'Ticket linter: 6 required fields, English, short body, no filler', 'Most tickets have no type, area, priority or estimate, titles mix PL/ES/EN, and the current hook only checks headings and 1500 chars.', '* Label groups in Linear: Type, Area, Market; templates Bug / Feature / Chore / Spike
