  VALUES ('CORE', 24, '[Future] Two-way calendar sync via Google/Outlook OAuth', '### Explicitly deferred — not v1

Placeholder to track the idea, not a committed scope. True bidirectional sync (edit in NeoCRM ↔ edit on the user''s own Google/Outlook calendar) would need per-user OAuth consent, token storage/refresh, and API quota handling — real engineering cost, and unclear whether patients have a linked Google/Microsoft account to sync against at all.

