pokaz mi to w artefakcie.', 'linear', 'import', '2026-09-27T23:46:41.537Z'::timestamptz FROM ins;
WITH ins AS (
  INSERT INTO platform.work_item
    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('CORE', 25, 'Send booking confirmation emails to HCP and patient', '### As a patient or doctor, I want an email when our appointment is booked, rescheduled, or canceled, so that I know about it without checking the app.

Depends on [NEO-27](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-27/design-new-appointment-entity-for-patientdoctor-visits-rbac) (the `appointment` entity must exist first). Uses `mailer.ts` (Resend) for delivery and the existing `notification` + `notification_delivery` tables for the in-app/audit trail. New i18n keys go in `packages/i18n/en.json` first per project convention (templates need PL/MX copies, not just EN).

Full enrichment (incl. GDPR/consent notes): `docs/stories/calendar-scheduling-epic.md`

### Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Confirmation email sent to patient + doctor on appointment create
- [ ] Update email sent on reschedule; cancellation email sent on cancel
- [ ] Email content is minimal (time, place, purpose) — no diagnosis/treatment detail in a channel NeoCRM can''t guarantee is private
- [ ] Sending is gated on the patient''s communication consent (check `consent` table) before sending to a patient
- [ ] Templates exist in en/pl/mx, CI i18n-parity check passes
- [ ] A failed email send never blocks/rolls back the underlying appointment write (log and continue, same pattern as apps/api/src/routes/booking.ts)
- [ ] Missing patient email on file (MVP, decided 2026-09-16): booking still succeeds, email send is silently skipped, an in-app notification tells the booking user "patient has no email on file, confirmation no…', NULL,
    NULL, 'needs_review', 3, ARRAY['Calendar']::text[],
    '[{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/65HTdwEdJgE2gbXZK7VS7e","title":"Artifact: CORE-25 Appointment Emails"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-25', 'linear',
    '2026-09-16T20:59:35.380Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-16T20:59:35.380Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-16T20:59:35.380Z'::timestamptz, NULL)
