  VALUES ('CORE', 38, 'Quarterly restore drill Q4 2026 — decrypt + restore a backup with the offline key', 'The nightly job proves each dump is restorable; this drill proves **we** can still download, decrypt and use a backup. Repeat every 3 months (next: 2027-03-15).

## Steps (docs/RUNBOOK_BACKUP_RESTORE.md → "Restore")

- [ ] Download the latest `neosleep-db-*.dump.age` and `neosleep-storage-*.tar.gz.age` from gs://neosleep-backups-db.
- [ ] Decrypt with the age private key from the password manager (`NeoSleep — klucz szyfrujący backupów (age)`).
- [ ] Restore the DB into a local Docker Postgres 17; open a few known patients and one sleep-study record.
- [ ] Unpack Storage; open one attachment.
- [ ] Delete the decrypted files afterwards (medical data).
- [ ] Also confirm the offline (printed/USB) key copy still exists.
- [ ] Record date + result in a comment here, then create the next quarterly drill ticket.', NULL,
