  VALUES ('CORE', 44, '3-button decisions in every Artifact + TDD-first, fewer questions', 'Questions for Łukasz and neoCRM staff arrive as long option lists or as plain text in the "Needs your decision" box, which can''t be clicked. There are also too many of them: many would be settled by a test anyway.', '* One shared decision widget: each question has exactly 3 buttons (yes · no · expanded variant with a specialist recommendation), a comment, and "Send to Claude"
