  VALUES ('CORE', 45, 'Remember list filters per user and per device (@neo/prefs)', 'List filters live in a single `app-settings` localStorage key that isn''t per user: on a shared device the next person sees someone else''s filters. Sort order and page size are lost on reload.', '* `packages/prefs` (`@neo/prefs`): `usePersistedView(viewId, defaults)`, key `neo:v1:{tenant}:{userId}:view:{viewId}`, validation against defaults, debounce, tab sync, fallback when storage is missing
