    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('CORE', 58, 'Stable CI: fix WebKit e2e flakes, API flakes, make all suites blocking', '12 of the last 100 CI runs failed and the last 3 pushes to `dev` are red. The failures are mostly WebKit e2e tests measuring layout mid-animation, plus 4 flaky API tests ([CORE-35](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-35/flaky-api-tests-3-4-intermittent-failures-under-the-full-parallel-run)). PWA/web unit tests pass but don''t block merges.', '* Plan + decisions (this ticket), then one shared `settle()` for e2e layout checks
* Fix the 5 WebKit/Firefox e2e flakes and the API flakes ([CORE-35](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-35/flaky-api-tests-3-4-intermittent-failures-under-the-full-parallel-run))
