    '- [ ] Łukasz has answered the plan''s decisions
- [ ] The 5 e2e specs pass 20× in a row on all 3 engines
- [ ] 10 consecutive green CI runs on `dev`', 'building', 1, ARRAY['Improvement']::text[],
    '[{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/D5fNVg33qczSFRj1nTTBgP","title":"Artifact: CORE-58 Stable CI Plan"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-58', 'linear',
