  VALUES ('CORE', 61, 'Honour "reduce motion" app-wide + a switch in the account menu', 'Only a few components respect the system "reduce motion" setting; dialogs, sheets and page transitions always animate. Users with motion sensitivity (WCAG 2.3.3) have no way to turn it off, and e2e layout tests must wait out every transition.', '* One global rule: with `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, transitions and animations become instant
