  VALUES ('CORE', 62, 'Nightly: a test that passed only on retry opens a CORE ticket', 'CI keeps 1 retry, so a flaky test turns green on the second attempt and nobody notices until it fails twice and blocks a merge.', '* The nightly flake hunt on `dev` collects every test that failed at least once
