  VALUES ('CORE', 97, 'Video engine for app walkthroughs + no-punctuation title check', 'The video pipeline built for the [NEO-204](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-204/30-second-linkedin-promo-teaser-patients-calendar-resources) teaser (real screens on demo data, composition, frame render) is needed for the instruction videos ([NEO-215](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-215/instruction-video-how-to-order-the-dam-in-neosleep-es-subtitles-our), [NEO-216](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-216/instruction-video-patient-module-for-doctors)), but it only exists on the unmerged [NEO-204](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-204/30-second-linkedin-promo-teaser-patients-calendar-resources) branch.', '* Move apps/pwa/scripts/promo-video (capture, fixtures, compose, render) to dev as-is
