  VALUES ('CORE', 104, 'Doctor sees only own patients — row-level access policy for all entities', 'A doctor can list and open patients assigned to other doctors. The API scopes patients and their sub-resources only by territory (country), never by the assigned doctor (patient.practitioner_id). Only appointments enforce "doctor sees own".', '* One central access policy (viewer = role + territory + own practitioner id) used by every list and by-id query
