  VALUES ('CORE', 110, 'Patient care team — many doctors per patient (dentist, pulmonologist, dietitian…)', 'A patient is treated by several doctors at once (dentist, pulmonologist, dietitian…), but the data model has one `patient.practitioner_id`. Since [CORE-104](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-104/doctor-sees-only-own-patients-row-level-access-policy-for-all-entities) a doctor sees only patients assigned to them, so a co-treating doctor can''t reach the patient, and the patient detail can''t show who treats them.', '* New `patient_care_team` table (patient, practitioner, specialty/role, added by, when), new numbered migration; current `practitioner_id` becomes the first member
