  VALUES ('CORE', 113, 'Pre-visit email: "your visit is today" + informed consent link', 'Patients arrive without the informed consent signed. Łukasz (2026-10-03): 2 h before the visit the patient should get "su cita es hoy" with the consent to sign. Data-processing docs flag that 2 h alone is late (long text, revocable before the procedure, easy to miss).', '* 2 h email (08–20 clinic time): visit today + consent-only link if the current consent is unsigned
