  VALUES ('CORE', 125, '"Adjust hue" setting under the avatar (eye-comfort presets)', 'Łukasz wants to show the product is modern and user-friendly: users should be able to pick a warmer "eye filter" look. Today the palette is fixed ([NEO-236](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-236/pwa-palette-more-contrast-less-medical-green-2-proposals) set a subtle warm white).', 'After the 7.10 demo: an "Adjust hue" option in the avatar menu with a few presets (cool / subtle warm, default / stronger warm / eye filter), not a free slider. Saved per user, works in dark mode too. Every preset keeps text, buttons and statuses at WCAG AA (≥4.5:1), checked by the palette contrast test.',
