  VALUES ('CORE', 127, 'PWA lists log dozens of Vue "Cannot set properties of null (setting ''value'')" errors', 'On pwa-dev (build 239, dev 7c04e6a), logging in and opening /patients logs \~37 console errors, /hco \~8 more: `[vue runtime-12] TypeError: Cannot set properties of null (setting ''value'')`. No visible breakage and no uncaught page error (so smoke-dev-ui passes), but something writes to a ref after its element/component is gone. Seen while verifying [CORE-43](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-43/pwa-hco-location-map-same-broken-google-maps-loader-as-the-old-website)/69; not caused by them (also on /patients).', '* Reproduce locally (prod build), find the component (likely a shared list/entity component or a template ref set after unmount)
* Guard or fix the write; add a vitest test that mounts/unmounts it without errors
* Optional: make smoke-dev-ui.mjs report console errors as warnings',
