  VALUES ('CORE', 131, 'Account button: role badge not clipped + focus style C (tinted pill + avatar ring)', 'The role badge on the app bar avatar ([CORE-114](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-114/user-avatar-role-badge-admin-star-doctor-specialty-manager-rep-kammsl)) is cut off at its right and bottom edge: Vuetify''s VBtn clips everything outside the button (overflow: hidden). The keyboard focus ring is the global teal outline around the whole name + avatar pill and looks heavy.', 'Decision form [CORE-114](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-114/user-avatar-role-badge-admin-star-doctor-specialty-manager-rep-kammsl)-account-focus-r1, D1 → C:

