  VALUES ('CORE', 133, 'History: every action on a patient or doctor leaves a trace', '3 bookings for "Paciente Prueba [NEO-231](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-231/clinical-forms-dra-lorena-feedback-round-1)" show as one; the doctor''s History shows nothing. Patient History reads only Patient/SleepStudy/TreatmentPlan audit rows, doctor History only Practitioner rows. Bookings, emails, questionnaires, documents, files, orders never appear. The patient card shows only the next appointment.', 'Tests first. History = every audit row about the entity or anything linked to it (appointments, questionnaires, signed docs, files, orders, notes, consent, emails), reads excluded. Doctor History adds their appointments and encounters. Patient card lists all appointments (upcoming + past). Field allowlist per type keeps clinical fields out.',
    '* 3 bookings → 3 entries in patient History and in the doctor''s History, plus reschedule/cancel.
* Each listed action has a test proving it appears.
* Patient card lists every appointment.', 'done', 1, '{}'::text[],
