  VALUES ('CORE', 134, 'Bell: unread badge not clipped + focus like the account button; app bar avatar stands out from the bar', 'The notification bell''s unread count badge is cut off (VBtn clips everything outside the button, same bug as [CORE-131](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-131/account-button-role-badge-not-clipped-focus-style-c-tinted-pill-avatar)). Its keyboard focus is Vuetify''s grey overlay inside the global teal outline. The app bar user avatar''s neutral grey fill nearly matches the bar background, so the circle washes out.', '* Bell button no longer clips; its hover/focus overlay stays round
