  VALUES ('CORE', 136, 'One search style: list searches look like the Doctor Panel search', 'The Doctor Panel search (Buscar paciente) is a soft glass field: filled, no outline, 14 px corners, glass surface + rim + blur. Every list search (Patients, Leads, HCP, HCO, Users… via AppEntityList) is an outlined pill. Two styles for the same control across the app.', 'Design first: a mockup Artifact showing the Patients list with the panel-style search (desktop + phone, empty / typing / focused), then restyle AppEntityList''s search to match once the design is approved. Behavior (clear button, phone icon-fold, loader) stays as is.',
    '* Łukasz approved a variant in the mockup Artifact
* All AppEntityList searches render with the panel style (glass, filled, 14 px radius, magnify icon)
* Phone fold-to-icon and clear button still work (existing specs green)
* Before/after screenshots in the Artifact', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/422","title":"CORE-136 List search: Doctor Panel glass style"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/Q5mb4ZSf4Wp56Z5eHEcMQZ","title":"Artifact: CORE-136 One Search Style"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-136', 'linear',
