  VALUES ('CORE', 137, 'Events can be linked to a patient and show on the patient card + History', 'Events (Evento / encounter) have no patient field, so an event made "for" a patient never shows on that patient''s card or in their History ([CORE-133](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-133/history-every-action-on-a-patient-or-doctor-leaves-a-trace) D1, Łukasz chose: link + show on card).', 'Tests first. Migration: optional `encounter.patient_id` (FK patient, ON DELETE SET NULL) + index; regenerate create_tenant_schema(). Event form gets an optional patient picker (scope-checked like appointments). Encounter audit rows carry patient_id, so getPatientTimeline picks them up. Patient card "Citas" section lists the patient''s events next to appointments (clinic/device time, type label).',
    '* An event created with a patient shows on that patient''s card and in their History.
* A user can only link patients in their scope (403 otherwise).
* Events without a patient behave as today.', 'done', 2, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/430","title":"CORE-137 Events can be linked to several patients"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/U1P23ZBBK3e1QjLToCLVt4","title":"Artifact: CORE-137 Events on the patient card (in progress)"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-137', 'linear',
