     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('CORE', 140, 'Admin card: lab order status sync (last run, open orders, check now)', 'The lab order status sync ([CORE-67](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-67/schedule-the-orthoapnea-order-status-sync-job)) runs in the background (every 15 min in the app, 4x a day on schedule), but an admin can''t see whether it ran, what it found, or why an order never updates. A manual run on 10-05 checked 0 orders and nobody could tell why from the app.', '* Record every sync run per tenant (trigger: app / schedule / manual, counts, error).
