* Dashboard card for admins: last run, counts, open orders, "Check now". No partner names on screen; en/pl/mx.',
    '* Admin Dashboard shows the last sync and the open orders with their last check.
* "Check now" runs a sync and the card updates.
* Non-admins get 403 and don''t see the card.
* API tests on real Postgres + card spec green; before/after screenshots in the Artifact.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/435","title":"CORE-140 Admin card for the lab order status sync (last run, open orders, check now)"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/VE2xwsqfR6fTSeyrcdatQT","title":"Artifact: CORE-140 Lab Sync Admin Card"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-140', 'linear',
