  VALUES ('CORE', 143, 'Patient card: refresh without F5, visit links, doctor view, green avatars', 'After booking a visit, editing the record or saving a study, the Detalles tab still showed old data until F5; an edit blanked the whole screen. The next visit and visit rows did not open the calendar. A doctor clicking an HCP name got bounced back to the panel and saw their own name in the side panel. Patient avatars: 4 nearly identical turquoises.', '`patient-changed` event + GET /patient/:id/version (fingerprint, no audit row, 60 s polling while visible + on return to the tab/app); edit refreshes in place; tile and Citas rows → /calendar?appointment=; doctor: HCP names without a link, own name hidden in the side panel; palette D3 variant 2 (8 tints).',
    'A visit booked from the card shows without F5; the edit doesn''t blank the screen; tile/row open the visit; a doctor sees no HCP links; avatars on 8 tints; tests green.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/447","title":"PR #447"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/CHcnAfEKqdz4A1rstWuVB2","title":"CORE-143 Artifact"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-143', 'linear',
