UNION ALL SELECT id, 'comment', NULL, 'Part 1 (who/where/how long on every audit row) is merged and live on pwa-dev. Part 2, your D2 answer, drops the never-used request_log table and the session foreign key; it is ready to merge below.
Artifact: https://claude.ai/artifact/7vn9KQtKhZM8ZNEbFYESSh
