     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('CORE', 150, 'One shared local test Postgres instead of a container per worktree', 'Every Claude session started its own `<slug>-test-pg` docker container for API tests and never stopped it. On 2026-10-06 there were 42 running (oldest 9 days, \~2 GB RAM of Docker''s 8 GB) plus \~25 GB of dead images/volumes/build cache. Stale `vite`/`tsx --watch` servers from finished worktrees were also left running for days.', '* Script (e.g. `infrastructure/scripts/test-db.sh up|down <slug>`): reuse one `neo-test-pg` container on port 55432, one database per worktree, write the worktree `.env` like CI, run migrate + sync-test-schema.
* `pnpm worktree:clean`: when it removes a worktree, drop its database, remove any legacy `*-test-pg` container for it and kill dev servers whose cwd is inside it.
* Point the memory/docs to the script (memory already updated 2026-10-06).',
    '* Two worktrees running API tests share one container.
* After worktree:clean, there is no container, DB or dev server left for removed worktrees (covered by a tooling self-test).', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/459","title":"CORE-150 Shared local test Postgres + Chromium-only e2e on work branches"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/L1NvPrXBmFvPgUWbixVhV3","title":"Artifact: CORE-150 + CORE-151 Lighter local dev and CI"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-150', 'linear',
