  VALUES ('CORE', 154, 'PWA version 1.1.0 + build number as 4th version segment', 'The PWA shows "Version 1.0.0 (build 317)". Łukasz bumps the app to 1.1.0 and wants the build number to be part of the version itself, counted automatically per version.', '* apps/pwa/package.json → 1.1.0
