    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('CORE', 156, 'Consent accept box: list the signed documents instead of a quoted title', 'On the patient signing page (/q) the accept checkbox reads «He leído «Consentimiento informado» y acepto su contenido.» The title sits in quotes (« », " ", „ ”), which looks odd. The label also only fits one document, so it can''t name everything being signed.', '* The label takes the list of documents being signed, not one quoted title.
* The names are joined in the right form for each language (Intl.ListFormat: "A y B", "A i B", "A and B") and shown as plain text like the privacy box (no bold, no quotes).
* "its content" becomes plural ("su contenido" → "sus contenidos" and so on) when there is more than one document.
* Applies to EN, PL and MX.',
    '* The label shows no quote characters.
* With one document it reads "He leído Consentimiento informado y acepto su contenido." (plain text)
* With 2 or more documents the names are joined correctly and the wording is plural.
* PatientQuestionnaireView.spec covers both cases.

Follow-up to [CORE-155](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-155/consent-accept-checkbox-names-the-document-it-accepts).', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
