  VALUES ('CORE', 157, 'Replace ~19 pwa source-string tests with behavior tests (or drop duplicates)', 'About 19 apps/pwa unit tests assert on the text of source files (e.g. "file contains X") instead of behavior. They break on every refactor and do not catch user-facing bugs. Decision D4 of ci-tests-r1 ([CORE-152](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-152/ci-run-only-what-a-change-can-break-path-gate-related-e2e-on-work)): [https://claude.ai/artifact/CY5H53nVn1BS8jeLkCE2tM](<https://claude.ai/artifact/CY5H53nVn1BS8jeLkCE2tM>)', '* List every pwa test that reads source files as text.
