  VALUES ('CORE', 158, 'Account menu: hide "My reports" when empty, fix Feedback icon', 'The account menu always shows "My reports" (Mis reportes), even for users who never sent a report: it opens an empty page. The Feedback (Comentarios) icon''s speech bubble sits off-center from its exclamation mark and looks broken.', '* Show "My reports" only when the signed-in user has at least one report (count from /api/v1/problem-reports/mine).
