    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('CORE', 161, 'Calendar: day list in a popover (pin to right) + phone month folds to week', 'Clicking a day in the Mes view shows no list of that day''s visits on tablet/desktop (the left sidebar was removed in [CORE-145](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/CORE-145/calendario-hide-mini-month-calendarios-sidebar-on-tabletdesktop) and Łukasz did not like it there). On phone the list sits under the full month, so long days scroll off.', 'Decided in [https://claude.ai/artifact/JsAaDB6dZQD2XMurqP1foZ](<https://claude.ai/artifact/JsAaDB6dZQD2XMurqP1foZ>) (D1 = A+C, D2 = more):

* Tablet/desktop: clicking a day opens a liquid-glass popover anchored to the cell with the day''s visits, "+" and "Abrir día →". A pin turns it into a panel docked on the right that follows the selected day; pin state remembered.
* Phone: list stays under the month; scrolling the list folds the month to the selected week (like iOS Calendar).
* Liquid glass on popover, pinned panel, toolbar.',
    '* Click a day in Mes (≥600 px) → popover with that day''s entries; Esc / outside click / period change closes it
* Pin → right panel, next day click updates it; unpin → back to popover
* Phone: list under month, month folds to selected week on scroll
* Row opens the entry; empty day offers "+"
* Tests cover the above; before/after screenshots', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/471","title":"CORE-161 Calendar: day list popover with pin, phone month folds to the week"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/Kmm2aniuZUBzsS49jm11Tk","title":"Artifact: CORE-161 Calendar Day List"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'CORE-161', 'linear',
