  VALUES ('CORE', 165, 'Calendar view-change animation spills outside the calendar (left/right)', 'When you switch calendar views (month ↔ week ↔ day) or page next/prev, the slide and zoom animations show outside the calendar area, over the sidebar on the left and past the edge on the right. The grid''s View Transition snapshot (`cal-body`) is painted in the top-level `::view-transition` overlay, which ignores the `overflow: hidden` on `.cal__main`, so the 18% slide and the 1.5× zoom are not clipped.', 'Clip `::view-transition-group(cal-body)` with `overflow: clip` in `CalendarView.vue`, so the animation stays inside the grid box. The motion itself (direction, duration, easing) does not change.',
