  VALUES ('CORE', 167, 'New appointment defaults to yesterday''s date; should default to tomorrow', 'Opening "Agendar cita" sometimes pre-fills yesterday''s date, and the field immediately shows "La fecha no puede ser pasada". The default is "next full hour" shown in the clinic''s time zone (MX, UTC−6), while the "no past" check uses the browser''s local date. When the browser (e.g. PL) is already on the next day, the clinic-zone default lands on the previous day.', '* A new appointment (no slot click / no preset start) defaults to tomorrow as the viewer sees it, at the clinic''s next full hour.
