  VALUES ('CORE', 170, 'Patient Detalles: one gutter for tiles and groups', 'On the patient card (Detalles tab) the gaps don''t match: the summary tiles sit 8 px apart, the Clínico/Contacto group columns 24 px apart, and the gap between sections is 20 px. Because of that, the second tile column doesn''t line up with the second group column under it.', '`PatientDetailsTab.vue` gets one `--pd-gutter` (16 px, `--space-4`). It''s used for the tile grid gap, the group column-gap, the space under each group and the gap between sections.',
    '* The tiles and groups have the same 16 px spacing.
* The left edge of the "IAH basal" tile lines up with the left edge of the "Contacto" column.
* The PatientDetailsTab specs are green.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
