  VALUES ('CORE', 171, 'Session-ended toast shows raw "session-ended" instead of translated text', 'When a session ends mid-use, the toast shows the raw string "session-ended" in every language. installSessionLossRedirect passes "session-ended" as the toast''s i18n `key`, and AppNotifications renders `t(key)` over the already-translated message — there is no such key, so vue-i18n returns it verbatim.', 'Drop the bogus toast key; main.ts already passes the translated `user.login.sessionEnded` (en/pl/mx) as the message.',
    '* Session-ended toast reads "Sesja wygasła. Zaloguj się ponownie." (PL) / "Tu sesión terminó…" (MX) / EN text
* Unit test asserts the toast is shown without an i18n key', 'done', 0, ARRAY['Bug']::text[],
