  VALUES ('NEO', 24, 'Partner registration: clinic-detail review UX, phone verification, signed-doc email delivery, scroll fix', 'Continuation of the partner registration / legal documents epic (`docs/stories/partner-registration-legal-documents.md`, addendum dated 2026-09-16).

Bundles:

1. Fix scroll bug on `PartnerRegistrationView.vue` blocking the signature pad (likely `AuthCard.vue`''s ResizeObserver-driven `.auth-card__viewport`).
2. Redesign clinic-detail fields (name, email, phone, address, Tax ID) as read-only-by-default with a guarded edit action, pre-filled from existing HCO/HCP records instead of re-typed.
3. Add a phone-number confirmation step (mechanism TBD — OTP vs re-type-confirm, open question).
4. Add invite-email copy recommending a phone/tablet+stylus for the e-signature step.
5. Email the signed PDF to the practitioner post-signing, cc''ing a configurable compliance address (interim env var, defaulting to [alfred.jan@neosleepcare.com](<mailto:alfred.jan@neosleepcare.com>)).
6. Confirmed via code investigation: PDF generation is real (pdf-lib, not a stub) but not jurisdiction-aware and not yet on the already-spiked puppeteer/HTML pipeline (`documentRenderer.ts`).

Full detail, stakeholder notes, and open questions in the story doc addendum.

Open questions needing Łukasz''s decision before implementation: OTP vs re-type phone confirmation; edit-interaction pattern (per-field modal vs group modal vs inline); ship on current pdf-lib pipeline or wait for puppeteer swap.', NULL,
