  VALUES ('NEO', 32, 'pwa-dev.neosleepcare.com serves GoDaddy placeholder instead of the built app', 'Confirmed 2026-09-16: `pwa-dev.neosleepcare.com` serves GoDaddy''s default/parked-domain placeholder (links to `/cpanel`, no `<script>`/`<link>` tags — not the built SPA shell at all), while `pwa.neosleepcare.com` (prod) serves the real app correctly. Isolated to the dev subdomain''s FTP path/DNS, not the app code — a merged PR ([NEO-24](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-24/partner-registration-clinic-detail-review-ux-phone-verification-signed)) couldn''t be visually verified on dev as a direct result.

Matches the known failure class from the 2026-07-30 GoDaddy FTP path incident (see `secrets/deploy-notes.md`, \[\[project_cicd_deployment_improvement_needed\]\] memory): `deploy-pwa.yml`''s FTP-Deploy-Action can report success while writing to the wrong directory, invisible until someone diffs GoDaddy''s File Manager against what CI claims to have deployed.

A branch already exists for this exact issue (`worktree-fix-pwa-dev-godaddy-parked`) but sits idle — 0 commits, never actually worked.

Needs: check the `GODADY_FTP_PWA_DEV` secret''s path against GoDaddy File Manager''s actual directory structure, confirm `deploy-pwa.yml`''s dev job has run/succeeded recently (Actions tab), and confirm DNS for the pwa-dev subdomain points at the right document root.', NULL,
