  VALUES ('NEO', 34, 'Build appointments view (dedicated screen, agenda for doctor, region/personal for staff)', '### As a doctor, rep, manager, or admin, I want an appointments screen suited to how much I actually need to see, so that it''s simple rather than a dense grid nobody wants to open.

Design decided with Łukasz 2026-09-16/17: a **new dedicated screen** (not folded into the existing rep-only `encounter`-based [PlannerView.vue](<../../apps/pwa/src/views/PlannerView.vue>) — different business concept, different audience). Reuse the same underlying Vuetify calendar component from PlannerView where it fits, so it looks familiar, but the data source and route are separate.

