  VALUES ('NEO', 53, 'Login page: NEOSLEEP logo white in light mode, dark in dark mode', 'Split out of [NEO-12](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-12/pwa-login) at Łukasz''s request (a different change on the same view).

**Problem:** on `/login` the NEOSLEEP logo does the opposite of the PWA badge and the app version under the card. It''s dark in light mode and white in dark mode, so it doesn''t match the rest of the page.

**Change:**

* Light mode shows the white logo (`logo_dark.svg`). Dark mode shows the dark logo (`logo_light.svg`, #4A4A49). Tenant overrides (`app_config.logo_dark_url` / `logo_url`) swap the same way.
* The glow behind the logo flips so it always contrasts with the logo. It''s a soft deep-teal shadow (#082A27, 32%) in light mode and a white glow in dark mode.
* Only the login page changes (`AuthChrome`). The logo in the app header and on the website stays as it is.

**Acceptance criteria:**

1. Light mode on `/login`: white logo, readable against the background.
2. Dark mode on `/login`: dark logo, readable against the background.
3. Toggling the theme swaps the logo and glow right away, with no reload.
4. The app header logo (`AppLogo`) and the website are unchanged.', NULL,
