  VALUES ('NEO', 55, 'PWA shell: logo top-left, account top-right, module title inside content card; mobile bottom bar + "More" sheet', 'Decided with Łukasz on 2026-09-24. Proposal and mockups: [https://claude.ai/artifact/5CWhknv6AHhwQMkVNai468](<https://claude.ai/artifact/5CWhknv6AHhwQMkVNai468>)

## Desktop

