* The module title (icon + name) moves out of the app bar into the **first row of the content card**. Detail views show `← <Module name>` (e.g. "← Patients"): the back arrow is followed by the module name, not the record name. The back arrow currently in ItemDetailLayout moves into this row so there is no second header row.

## Mobile (option A)

* No logo on mobile. Top bar: \[← back, detail views only\] + module title … avatar (top right, opens account menu).
* No hamburger menu. Bottom bar: the first 4 menu items (as today) + a 5th tab, "More".
* ~~"More" opens a bottom sheet listing the remaining modules only.~~ **Revised 2026-09-25:** "More" expands the bottom bar in place into a **grid of all modules**. There is no heading and the current module is highlighted. Bar items animate to their grid slots, and "More" becomes a Close chevron. It closes on the chevron, a scrim tap, a drag down, Escape, or…', NULL,
