  VALUES ('NEO', 56, 'PWA: record header with breadcrumb (Salesforce/Veeva pattern) + patient date of birth', 'Record header on every PWA detail view. Decided by Łukasz on 2026-09-25 over three rounds; the final pick is **pattern B, the Salesforce Lightning / Veeva record header**, chosen out of 4 ([https://claude.ai/artifact/Kw5EZnheAiHDzZHSipjgts](<https://claude.ai/artifact/Kw5EZnheAiHDzZHSipjgts>)). Result: [https://claude.ai/artifact/6qvyto9Rd2C2d9Jpv7GrXS](<https://claude.ai/artifact/6qvyto9Rd2C2d9Jpv7GrXS>)

