- [ ] The HCO tile shows the org-type icon ([NEO-18](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-18/pwa-clinic)). The existing badges stay next to the name.
- [ ] Phone: the same block with no horizontal scroll, and the name on its own row.
- [ ] A long name w…', NULL,
