  VALUES ('NEO', 59, 'Estudios: "Agregar estudio" doesn''t save the uploaded file (pwa-dev)', 'Łukasz reported this on 2026-09-25 on pwa-dev, after PR [lukasz512/NeoSleep#183](https://linear.app/neosleep/review/neo-36-estudios-checklist-one-qr-per-patient-phone-signed-consent-b886154542af) ([NEO-36](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-36/historia-endo-intake-checklist-stop-bang-screening-printable-pdf)) merged. In the patient''s Estudios tab, "Agregar estudio" (upload a file from the doctor''s disk with a title and notes, either as a new study or attached to an item) does not save: the new study never lands in the database.

## Where to look

The flow is:

1. `StudyUploadDialog.vue` builds a FormData and `usePatientChecklist.upload()` sends `POST /api/v1/patient/:id/studies/uploads`.
2. Route `routes/patient.ts`: multer, PDF/JPG/PNG, 15 MB limit.
3. `UploadPatientStudyCommand` (`commands/patientChecklist.ts`) calls `uploadPartnerDocument` (Supabase Storage, bucket `partner-documents`), then writes a `file_attachment` row with `metadata.document_type = ''study_upload''`.

Locally, against a stand-in storage, this flow worked end to end (screenshots in the [NEO-36](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-36/historia-endo-intake-checklist-stop-bang-screening-printable-pdf) Artifact). So the likely cause is specific to pwa-dev:

* Supabase Storage: the bucket or its permissions for the `patient/<id>/…` path.
* Request size or multipart handling on the way to Render.
* CORS or the content type on the multipart request.
* The API returns an error that the toast doesn''t make obv…', NULL,
    '* A file uploaded on pwa-dev shows up in Estudios (attached to an item or under "Otros archivos") and survives a reload.
* The Render log for the request shows the real cause.
* A regression test covers that cause.

Context: [NEO-36](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-36/historia-endo-intake-checklist-stop-bang-screening-printable-pdf), ADR-024 §2. Artifact: [https://claude.ai/artifact/MuNVczXxjEiLgPixiJhBJ6](<https://claude.ai/artifact/MuNVczXxjEiLgPixiJhBJ6>)', 'done', 2, '{}'::text[],
