  VALUES ('NEO', 76, 'PWA toasts: record-context design (entity icon, record line, Retry action)', 'Łukasz picked direction **D, "Kontekst rekordu"**, from the toast proposals: [https://claude.ai/artifact/Baf8wJMCibHqpdw1xnanRh](<https://claude.ai/artifact/Baf8wJMCibHqpdw1xnanRh>) (v2, entity icon on a grey tile).

## Scope (the whole change ships in one session)

* Redesign `AppNotifications.vue`:
  * white card with a **grey** entity-icon tile and a small status badge (success/info/warning/error)
  * title plus an optional record/context line
  * an optional action button
  * light and dark themes
* Extend `useNotifications().show()` with optional `{ icon, context, action }`. It stays backward-compatible: a call without an icon gets a generic icon per type.
* Migrate every call site (\~70) to pass an entity icon, and a record context where the view has one.
* Add a **Retry** ("Ponów") action on error toasts wherever the failed operation can simply be re-invoked (save, delete, load). Add **Now** ("Teraz") on the reload countdown, and **Reload** on the chunk-load failure.
* Keep:
  * `role="alert"`/`"status"` ([NEO-10](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-10/login-page-pwa))
  * the z-index above dialogs
  * swipe-to-dismiss

## Acceptance

* Every toast renders with an icon, and the icon tile is neutral grey.
* Retry actually re-runs the failed operation and is verified on each view.
* EN/PL/MX parity for the new keys.
* Real before/after screenshots in the Artifact.', NULL,
