  VALUES ('NEO', 79, 'Website find-a-specialist map: refactor to current API + app quality, and fix silent error handling', 'Łukasz, 2026-09-25, on [dev.neosleepcare.com](<http://dev.neosleepcare.com>): the map loads but "No se pudieron cargar los especialistas". Nothing appears in the browser console ("totalnie źle zrobiona obsługa błędów"). He asked to refactor the map ("jest już mocno stara, nasze API mocno się zmieniło") to the same quality as the rest of the app, and to audit the codebase for the same silent-error pattern.

## Found so far

* **Immediate cause, fixed in** [NEO-45](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-45/investigate-and-fix-appsapi-slowness-on-render-free-plan) (branch `worktree-neo-45-web-api-url`): the website build never had an API base URL. `deploy-web.yml` read a `VITE_API_URL` secret that never existed, so `/api/v1/public/specialists` went to the static GoDaddy host and 404''d. The website now uses the per-branch `API_URL_DEV` / `API_URL_PROD` secrets, and the Cloud Run CORS lists include the website origins.
* **Silent failure:** the web client catches the failure and shows a generic message without logging anything or distinguishing 404, CORS, network and 5xx. There is no diagnostics trail.

## Scope (to shape via /enrich-user-story + /ux + plan)

1. Audit error handling across apps/web and apps/pwa for swallowed errors: catch blocks that neither log nor report, and generic messages hiding the cause. Define one pattern (log with context, report to diagnostics, user-facing message by error class) and apply it.
2. Refactor the find-a-specialist map (`apps/web`) against t…', NULL,
