  VALUES ('NEO', 81, 'One error-handling pattern for web + PWA: no more silent errors (log, report, classify)', 'Łukasz, 2026-09-25: the website''s specialist map failed with nothing in the browser console ("totalnie źle zrobiona obsługa błędów — napraw i sprawdź, czy gdzieś jeszcze nie ma podobnego rozwiązania"). He decided this ships **first, as its own ticket, before the** [NEO-79](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-79/website-find-a-specialist-map-refactor-to-current-api-app-quality-and) **map refactor**, which will reuse the pattern.

