* `FindSpecialistView.vue`: a Maps load failure and JSON parse errors are swallowed and shown as a generic message.
* ContactView / EventoView: failed web3forms submits leave no trace, so patient leads can be lost silently.
* PWA: `useEntityList.ts` and detail views treat every error as "offline". 13 load panels and 16 save paths show generic messages and never report.
* The server generates `X-Request-ID` but never returns it, so browser errors can''t be matched to server logs.
* `POST /api/v1/diagnostics` has no dedicated rate limiter. It needs one before the public site us…', NULL,
