  VALUES ('NEO', 84, 'Ship rules: ticket + artifact for every change, 3 links, artifact index, auto-cleanup of merged worktrees', 'Closed worktrees and branches pile up: 30 worktrees and about 50 local branches on 2026-09-26. Small changes ship without a ticket. The artifacts and tickets are long, and there is no single place that lists the changes.', '* Every change needs a NEO ticket, trivial ones included. The hook blocks a branch whose name has no ticket ID.
* The artifact and the ticket always carry 3 links: Artifact, Linear and VS Code (the session).
* One index artifact: one line per change (ticket, status, 1 sentence, links), updated by ship-artifact.
* Shorter formats: limits in build.mjs (summary, headline, notes). A ticket description has to fit the template Problem / Change / Done when.
* worktree:clean also handles local branches without a worktree. `--auto` removes merged worktrees and branches automatically at session start. Unmerged ones are only listed.
* Permission for `pnpm worktree:clean` only, never for raw `git branch -D`.',
    '* The quality gate fails without a ticket, without the 3 links, or without the index updated.
* The session start leaves no merged worktrees or branches, and does not touch unmerged or locked ones.
* [worktree-clean.test.sh](<http://worktree-clean.test.sh>) covers the new cases.', 'done', 3, '{}'::text[],
