  VALUES ('NEO', 85, 'PWA "Record stack" paper look + motion (variant C)', 'Łukasz picked **variant C + animations** (2026-09-26) from the proposal: [https://claude.ai/artifact/XFxAZaSAVgL56X5qxhdrAt](<https://claude.ai/artifact/XFxAZaSAVgL56X5qxhdrAt>)

**Look**

