* Dialogs: white paper, deep soft drop shadow, one sheet under the bottom edge; filled teal primary button (Save)

**Motion** (all behind `prefers-reduced-motion`)

* Page: sheet rises 10px + fades; rows stagger in (+35ms each), M3 emphasized decelerate
* Row hover tint + press feedback (scale .99)
* Dialog grows from the tapped element, closes faster (360ms / 180ms); on phone it slides up as a bottom sheet
* Field focus: teal border + 3px halo

**Constraints**: dark theme designed too; white-label tenant primary colour (app_config) must still drive teal; mobile + desktop.

