  VALUES ('NEO', 92, 'PWA: Carpeta edit/create view (folder with spine) for forms with ≥2 sections', 'In the edit dialog (e.g. "Editar paciente"), once you scroll, the divider under the header touches the field ("Apellido"). The divider is drawn at the edge of the scroll area, and the outlined field''s label overflows the frame. Łukasz asked for a new edit view that fits the record-stack style ([NEO-85](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-85/pwa-record-stack-paper-look-motion-variant-c)) and looks like a sheet of paper or a card.

## Decision

Variant C "Carpeta" was chosen from 3 proposals: [https://claude.ai/artifact/LL9B9HnsGfcJNZpFj9iptW#c](<https://claude.ai/artifact/LL9B9HnsGfcJNZpFj9iptW#c>)
Scoping answers (decision form): [https://claude.ai/artifact/XS8BD5QzFsHZ7Ao6EzXFuw](<https://claude.ai/artifact/XS8BD5QzFsHZ7Ao6EzXFuw>)

* A1: folder with a spine for FormRenderer forms with ≥2 sections (patient, HCP, HCO, lead, user). Short forms stay a single sheet in the same style.
* A2: **add and edit are the same view**, one component in create/edit mode. On create, the spine fills in live as fields are typed.
* A3: the OrthoApnea wizard and the questionnaires come later, in a separate ticket.
* B1: one long sheet, with a scroll-spy section index on the spine.
* B2: full identity on the spine (the same source as the [NEO-56](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-56/pwa-record-header-with-breadcrumb-salesforceveeva-pattern-patient-date) record header).
* B3: a dot next to each section with unsaved changes, plus a change counter in the footer.
* C1: no serif. The system fon…', NULL,
    '* Content fades out below the header in every scroll position and never touches it (e2e measurement in a real browser).
* Sections come from config (a `section` key on FormFieldDef), with no per-entity code.
* Phone (<600px): a bottom sheet, with the section index shown as chips.
* i18n parity for EN/PL/MX.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/262","title":"NEO-92 Carpeta form folder (edit + create)"},{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/258","title":"NEO-92 Carpeta form folder (edit + create)"},{"kind":"spec","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/GKE6cSaCfhqYeCgGhGkvZk","title":"Artifact: NEO-92 Carpeta Form Folder"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-92', 'linear',
