  VALUES ('NEO', 93, 'Estudios: QR button absorbs the pending-link banner (status button)', '**Problem**
The Estudios tab shows the "QR para el paciente" button and a separate orange "Esperando al paciente" banner per pending link. On phone the error/status button and "Añadir estudio" stack in two rows at different heights.

**Change** (variant B, decided by Łukasz 2026-09-26 — design: [https://claude.ai/artifact/2eSsAV2AnDhZJt5iaN2NGQ](<https://claude.ai/artifact/2eSsAV2AnDhZJt5iaN2NGQ>))

* The QR button becomes the link status: idle → creating (striped) → waiting "Esperando al paciente" with `x de n · vence en hh:mm:ss` and a fill = progress → "Todo recibido" (\~2 s) → hides when nothing is left for the patient. Error → "Reintentar". "⋯" opens details + "Mostrar QR de nuevo" / "Cancelar enlace" (inline confirm).
* Pending banner removed.
* "Añadir estudio" → green tonal plus; label on desktop, icon-only 44×44 on phone; both buttons 44 px, one row on phone.
* New QR cancels **every** previous pending link of the patient (not only overlapping items) → one live link per patient.

**Done when**

* All states render as in the artifact on desktop + phone, i18n EN/PL/MX parity.
* API test: creating a link cancels all other pending links of that patient.
* Verified on pwa-dev after merge.', NULL,
