UNION ALL SELECT id, 'comment', NULL, 'Follow-up (Łukasz: signatures must be bigger on the PDF). The patient''s phone signature used to shrink into a 15 mm box and came out as a thin scribble on the consent PDF. The box is now 26 mm, so the signature reads clearly on every signed document.
First PR (#264, full-screen signing) is merged and verified on pwa-dev: the new code is live, and the pages open on desktop and phone with no errors.
