  VALUES ('NEO', 109, 'Form errors shown in the form (inline + summary), not as toasts', 'Form validation errors the server returns (e.g. birth date 0001, bad email) only show a generic "Error al guardar" toast. No field turns red, and the user can''t tell what to fix.

## Decided (Łukasz, 2026-09-26): variant B

Design options: [https://claude.ai/artifact/1T2UmzAgrNKnQAs1pC9bc2](<https://claude.ai/artifact/1T2UmzAgrNKnQAs1pC9bc2>)

* Inline error under each invalid field (red outline + message).
* A summary box at the top of the form listing every error. Each line jumps to its field. The box disappears as fields get fixed.
* Section headers show an error count.
* **Neighbouring controls keep their original height.** The sex toggle must not stretch when the date field next to it shows an error message.
* The API returns field-level errors. FormRenderer maps them to fields. The toast stays only for network or server errors and for success.
* Built once in FormRenderer, so it applies to every form.

## Extended (Łukasz, 2026-09-26): every form in the app

"All forms in the app must behave this way." Same PR: the API names the field for all validations (inferred from the message, plus a `reason`), and every hand-written form uses the same pattern: event, appointment, OrthoApnea wizard, partner registration, login/forgot/reset/change password. Login''s "wrong email or password" moves from a toast into the form (reverses [NEO-10](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-10/login-page-pwa)).

## Open

* Birth date range: 1900 → today — already enforced by the API; the patie…', NULL,
    '* Saving a patient with birth date 0001 marks that field, lists it in the summary, and shows no toast.
* A server-side email rejection marks the email field.
* A network or 500 error still shows a toast.
* The sex toggle height is unchanged when the date field shows an error.
* Works at phone width and in the Carpeta form layout.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/281","title":"NEO-109 Form errors shown in the form (inline + summary), not as toasts"},{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/278","title":"NEO-109 Form errors shown in the form (inline + summary), not as toasts"},{"kind":"spec","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/W4pnz7bt27hthCiL7GohBi","title":"Artifact: NEO-109 Form Errors"},{"kind":"spec","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/1T2UmzAgrNKnQAs1pC9bc2","title":"Artifact: Form error display options"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-109', 'linear',
