  VALUES ('NEO', 110, 'QR dialog closes itself when the patient opens the link; drop its duplicate tracking', 'The "Escanee para llenar" QR dialog stays open after the patient scans and keeps its own progress line ("0 de 3 pasos completados") and a "Received" end view. That tracking already lives in the QR status button ([NEO-93](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-93/estudios-qr-button-absorbs-the-pending-link-banner-status-button)) and in the Estudios summary, so the dialog duplicates it and has to be closed by hand.', '* Record when the patient first opens the link (`questionnaire_request.opened_at`, new migration; set on the public GET).
