    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('NEO', 122, 'Account menu opens from the avatar (soft bloom animation)', '**Problem**
The account menu opens below the avatar button, so the user''s name shows twice (button + menu header), and the menu just pops in.

**Change** (approved 2026-09-26, prototype "A+" in [https://claude.ai/artifact/PsaWPdgfuqQXjVu1NnqoqA](<https://claude.ai/artifact/PsaWPdgfuqQXjVu1NnqoqA>))

* Desktop: the menu card opens in place of the avatar button. Its header avatar sits exactly on the button''s avatar; the card blooms out of the avatar with a soft edge; name and role travel from the button into the header; rows arrive one after another and sharpen; shadow and a light page dim come in last. Closing reverses it, faster.
* Phone: bottom sheet stays; the avatar flies in an arc from the top-right into the sheet header; rows stagger in.
* Reduced motion: the menu appears/disappears instantly.
* Esc and click outside close it; focus returns to the avatar button.

**Done when**

* Name is shown once while the menu is open, on desktop and phone.
* Motion matches the prototype (timings/easings) and is skipped with prefers-reduced-motion.
* Keyboard: open with Enter/Space, close with Esc, focus goes back to the button.', NULL,
    NULL, 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/290","title":"NEO-122 Account menu grows out of the avatar button (soft bloom)"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-122', 'linear',
