WITH ins AS (
  INSERT INTO platform.work_item
    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('NEO', 124, 'Rename "Historia Endo" form to "Historia Clínica" (MAD)', '**Problem**
The printable intake form is called "Historia Endo — Historia Clínica de Endodoncia" (endodontics). The form is used for MAD (mandibular advancement device / DAM) treatment, not for root-canal procedures — for now.

**Change**
Rename the user-facing labels only (app + PDF), in EN / PL / MX:

* Title: "Historia Clínica" (EN "Clinical History", PL "Historia kliniczna")
* Subtitle: "Tratamiento con Dispositivo de Avance Mandibular (DAM)" (EN "Mandibular Advancement Device (MAD) Therapy")
* Studies checklist item, document type, document-content label, abbreviation HE → HC
* Internal keys / DB (`historiaEndo`, `endo_intake`) stay unchanged.

**Open (for Łukasz)**

* "Tooth" field and the hand-written "Clinical notes" hint (pain history, radiographs…) are endodontic — keep or remove for MAD?
* The consent text inside the form is admin-authored content in the DB (root-canal consent); it needs a MAD consent text from the clinic/legal.

**Done when**
