  VALUES ('NEO', 125, 'PWA shows the previous version after a deploy until a second visit', 'After a deploy, anyone who has opened the PWA before (staff app or a patient QR link) still gets the old version: the service worker serves the cached build, downloads the new one in the background, and never reloads. Łukasz saw [NEO-116](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-116/patient-questionnaire-privacy-notice-collapsed-under-the-consent) as "still old" on pwa-dev although it was live.', 'Register the service worker through vite-plugin-pwa''s registerSW (autoUpdate) with clientsClaim, so a newly activated version takes over and the page reloads once, straight away. Also check for an update when the tab regains focus.',
    'After a new dev deploy, reopening an already-visited page shows the new build without a manual refresh; no reload loop; unsent questionnaire answers survive (local draft).', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/320","title":"NEO-125 PWA: switch to a new deploy whenever the page is untouched"},{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/300","title":"NEO-125 PWA reloads into a new deploy instead of the cached build"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/SWuBqFmwSNdGJ6x1K2JK8w","title":"Artifact: NEO-125 PWA Picks Up New Deploys"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-125', 'linear',
