     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('NEO', 134, 'Engine core: event catalog, notify() and delivery log', 'Producers write to `notification` directly with ad-hoc text. Nothing decides channels, and nothing writes `notification_delivery`. Two producers exist today: the OrthoApnea sync and appointments.', '* Add a typed event catalog in code. For each type: category (security/legal/operational/marketing), default channels, priority (operational only), i18n keys for a PHI-free title/body, deep-link builder, and grouping key.
