* Group identical `(recipient, type, entity)` events within 5 min.
* Add a `priority` column (default normal; a manual urgent flag comes later).
* Migrate both existing producers to `notify()`.',
    '* Integration tests on a real DB cover catalog lookup, fan-out rows, 5-min grouping, and recipient locale.
* Both producers use notify().
* No PHI in title/body, enforced by a test on the catalog.', 'done', 2, ARRAY['Notifications', 'Feature']::text[],
