  VALUES ('NEO', 151, 'Resources: video tile grid redesign (mockup, 2 options)', 'Webinars in Resources look heavy: an extra tab bar with only one tab, bordered cards around a native black player, plain "ES" text chips, and no thumbnails, so every video is a black box. Videos load slowly (streamed through the API in 8 MiB range slices), and there is no loading, buffering or error state.', 'Mockup artifact with 2 tile-grid options: one label, 3/2/1 columns (desktop/tablet/phone), flag language labels, fewer borders, video as a tile, and animated loading, buffering, playing and error states. Plus 2 ideas to reach the planned path faster (thumbnails and faster start).',
    'Łukasz picks an option and the ideas in the artifact. Implementation is a follow-up on this ticket.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
    '[{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/331","title":"NEO-151 Resources: small video cards by stage, posters on Linux, soft player"},{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/lukasz512/NeoSleep/pull/321","title":"NEO-151 Resources: webinar poster tiles, subtitle, full-screen player"},{"kind":"artifact","url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/ESsYTnJSwpbZn9Y4g1xr6F","title":"Artifact: NEO-151 Resources video tiles"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-151', 'linear',
