  VALUES ('NEO', 152, 'List views: header, table, skeleton, mobile record header and smoother motion', 'List titles are small, the table and skeleton jump while loading, the filter icon looks bigger than its neighbours, the phone record page uses an older layout, and page and search transitions stutter on phones.', '* List header: 28 px title, count subtitle on desktop only, search shrinks to an icon when space runs out
