  VALUES ('NEO', 153, 'Detail views: narrower tab column, underline tabs, fade transition, desktop side panel', 'On desktop, detail-view tab content (Patient/HCP/HCO) spans the full screen (\~1550 px), the horizontal slide transition clips fields, and the notes compose box/empty state feel oversized. Proposal agreed in the design artifact: option B, underline tabs, fade.', '* Tab content column max 720 px on desktop
