  VALUES ('NEO', 173, 'Estudios: live refresh + "Nuevo" marker on new results', 'When a patient fills a questionnaire/consent via QR, the open Estudios tab only updates while the QR dialog is open. Nothing marks results the current user has not seen yet.

## Change (decided via scoping form [https://claude.ai/artifact/GJSCLGajRxraYjUUA77eSg](<https://claude.ai/artifact/GJSCLGajRxraYjUUA77eSg>))

