* "Nuevo" chip on a row added by someone other than me (patient via QR, other staff) until I open that result. Per user. Clinical roles only (admin, doctor, manager).

## Not in scope (later, tracked in backlog)

Notifications: recipients = QR creator + treating doctor + admins + all clinical; bell in top bar for all roles; in-app only, no push/email.', NULL,
