  VALUES ('NEO', 177, 'Email deliverability test: Outlook, Gmail, home.pl, Onet, WP + mail-tester score', 'Emails to patients can be accepted by Resend ("Delivered") yet never reach the patient''s inbox: they land in spam, in a quarantine, or in a folder the mail client doesn''t show. Łukasz, 2026-09-28: "this is key from a functionality point of view". [NEO-162](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-162/send-by-email-on-patient-email-not-received-doctor-chooses-which) test: the email reached the [home.pl](<http://home.pl>) mailbox, but Outlook only showed it after a long delay.', 'A repeatable deliverability test before every release that changes an email:

* Send every patient and doctor email template to [Outlook.com](<http://Outlook.com>), Gmail, [home.pl](<http://home.pl>), Onet and WP.
* For each one, record Inbox, Spam or Missing, and the delay.
* Record the score on [mail-tester.com](<http://mail-tester.com>): SPF, DKIM, DMARC, content and links.
* Keep the results as a table in the release Artifact.
* Possible automation later: GlockApps or a seed list.',
    '* There is one seed-list test email address per provider (recorded in secrets/accounts.md).
* A script or checklist for the test exists, and the first run is recorded.

