  VALUES ('NEO', 185, 'Patient list: mark patients with new Estudios results ("Nuevo")', 'Estudios already knows per user which results are new ([NEO-173](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-173/estudios-live-refresh-nuevo-marker-on-new-results): added by someone else — patient via QR or another staff member — after 2026-09-28 and not yet opened by this user). The patient list doesn''t show it, so a doctor has to open each patient to find new results (Łukasz, 2026-09-28).

