  VALUES ('NEO', 191, 'Doctor alert when a patient email bounces, with a "fix email" link', '[NEO-190](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-190/stage-0-resend-webhook-patient-email-send-log-with-delivery-status) records bounces, but nobody finds out about them until someone opens the send history.', '* When the webhook reports `email.bounced` for a patient email, the notification engine ([NEO-134](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-134/engine-core-event-catalog-notify-and-delivery-log)) sends an in-app alert to the doctor who sent it.
* The alert carries a "fix email" link to the patient''s address field.
* Spam complaints and delays don''t raise an alert; they only show as a status in the history (Łukasz, 2026-09-29).
* The copy contains no health data: the alert shows the patient''s name and the fact that the email didn''t reach them.',
    '* A bounce creates exactly one alert for the sender (integration test).
* A spam complaint or delay creates no alert.', 'backlog', 3, '{}'::text[],
    '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-191', 'linear',
