  VALUES ('NEO', 192, 'Stage 1: "Send by email" dialog — pick documents, send history, 7-day link', 'The "Send by email" button fires immediately with every open questionnaire, and the doctor can''t see what was sent or whether it arrived.', '* The button opens a dialog. It lists the documents the patient can fill or sign online; the open ones are pre-checked.
* The dialog shows the masked recipient address, a "check your SPAM folder" hint, a "copy link" button, and an optional confirmation for the doctor (no active links).
