    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('NEO', 194, 'Historia Clínica Odontológica — one form after Dra. Lorena''s 13 sections', 'Historia Clínica is only a printout today, assembled from Cuestionario médico + Exploración de cavidad oral. Dra. Lorena needs a single form that follows her paper "Historia Clínica Odontológica" (13 sections). The STOP-Bang B question also asks for height every time.', '* One Historia Clínica record/form in Documentos with her 13 sections: datos generales, motivo, antecedentes médicos/odontológicos, historia actual, hábitos, sueño, exploración clínica (signos vitales, odontograma, periodontograma, imagen), evaluación, ATM, STOP-Bang, plan, consentimiento.
* Cuestionario médico, STOP-Bang and Exploración become its sections. Data is entered once, and the patient can still self-fill by QR ([NEO-193](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-193/rozmowa-z-dr-lorena-historia-clinica-y-docuemntos-en-general) D1).
* Talla is captured once in signos vitales. STOP-Bang B asks only for peso and computes BMI from the stored talla ([NEO-193](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-193/rozmowa-z-dr-lorena-historia-clinica-y-docuemntos-en-general) D4).
* The PDF matches her layout. The doctor signs with name + cédula profesional. It is append-only, with corrections as an addendum (NOM-004 §5.10/5.11).',
    '- [ ] The doctor fills all 13 sections in one form and prints a PDF that matches the paper form
- [ ] STOP-Bang B shows only peso and uses the talla from signos vitales
- [ ] Existing questionnaire/exploración records appear in the new Historia Clínica
- [ ] A signed record cannot be edited; a correction creates an addendum', 'backlog', 1, '{}'::text[],
    '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'linear_import', 'NEO-194', 'linear',
    '2026-09-29T22:53:46.397Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-29T22:53:46.397Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-29T22:53:46.397Z'::timestamptz, NULL)
