  VALUES ('NEO', 221, 'Patients list: Documentos + Estudios columns, Siguiente paso + QR instead of Estado', 'The patients list shows a "Formularios" column that mixes documents and the PSG study, and an Estado chip that doesn''t help anyone act on the patient. Decided in form patients-list-columns-r1 (D1 = A + QR, D2 = phone QR only): [https://claude.ai/artifact/5QLVxMcTsaEvvEZ7fWTUgB](<https://claude.ai/artifact/5QLVxMcTsaEvvEZ7fWTUgB>)', '* Rename Formularios → Documentos; move PSG into a new Estudios column
