    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('NEO', 225, 'Order form Paso 2: tighter SP/ruler block, Morning Aligner as a visual card', 'In the device order wizard (step 2, "Paso 2: Configuración del tratamiento"), the Starting Point % / mm steppers sit in a vertical, right-aligned stack, which leaves a large empty gap above the mandibular ruler. Morning Aligner is a bare checkbox squeezed under "Férulas adicionales", with its picture hidden behind an (i) tooltip, so it is easy to miss.', 'Proposal first (mockup Artifact), then build:

* SP: header + % | mm steppers in one row, ruler right under them, top padding cut.
* Morning Aligner: its own visual card at the end of Paso 2 (image thumbnail, short description, toggle), separated from the sequence block but still inside Paso 2.',
    '* Łukasz picks a variant in the mockup Artifact.
* Gap above the ruler ≤ 16 px at desktop and phone width.
* Morning Aligner shows as a card with image + toggle; order.morningAligner still binds and is sent unchanged.
* Before/after screenshots in the Artifact.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
