  VALUES ('NEO', 226, 'Doctor''s new-patient form: hide Territorio/Estado, phone defaults to MX, nicer clinical block', 'When a doctor adds a patient, the form shows Región/Territorio and Estado, which doctors shouldn''t set for now. The phone defaults to +48 because the doctor''s identity has no country_code, even though their territory is MX. The Clínico block (AHI, CPAP switch, Expediente) looks plain.', '* Hide region, territory_id and status from the doctor role in patientForm.ts.
