  VALUES ('NEO', 227, 'Device order: upload digital scan files to OrthoApnea (replace the "coming later" notice)', 'Registro dental in the device order wizard shows "La subida de archivos digitales llegará en una actualización posterior". Doctors who scan (intraoral scanner / platform) must upload the STL files in OA''s own system afterwards. Łukasz (2026-10-04) wants this in production now.', '* Capture OA''s portal file-upload request once (field name, multipart parts next to `treatmentDTO`, allowed extensions, size limits, per scanner) — docs/orthoapnea-wizard-fidelity.md says the shape was never captured. Test order labelled PRUEBA DEMO, Łukasz''s OK before sending.
