    (team_key, number, title, problem, change, done_when, status, priority, labels, links, branch,
     source, linear_identifier, created_by, created_at, updated_at, status_changed_at, completed_at)
  VALUES ('NEO', 231, 'Clinical forms: Dra. Lorena feedback round 1', 'Dra. Lorena (MX clinical lead) reviewed the clinical forms and asked for 5 changes. Decisions D1–D5 were answered in [https://claude.ai/artifact/1ihmjK959C7q9Tq7EE85Tx](<https://claude.ai/artifact/1ihmjK959C7q9Tq7EE85Tx>). Reference: docs/clinical/protocolo-atencion/README.md ([NEO-230](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-230/add-dra-lorenas-care-protocol-protocolo-de-atencion-as-clinical)).', '* Informed consent: drop Biologix. Manufacturing is only OrthoApnea. Already-signed consents keep their text.
* Exploración de cavidad oral: remove the "Diente" field (app + HC PDF).
* STOP-BANG IMC: only Peso. Height comes from the patient card; BMI and the B answer are computed, with manual entry when height is missing.
* Historia clínica: one tile with tabs Antecedentes · STOP-BANG · Exploración · ATM and an "x de 4" progress counter.
* ATM tab: 5 symptoms × Derecho/Izquierdo, apertura máxima 0–80 mm, and a skull illustration that highlights the marked side. Legacy Sí/No answers stay readable, and the HC PDF prints the ATM table.',
    '* Specs cover each change, written first (TDD).
* On pwa-dev: patient → Documentos shows the HC tile with 4 tabs and an ATM tab; there is no Diente and no Talla; the consent PDF has no Biologix.
