  VALUES ('NEO', 233, 'Doctor Panel: Today + Needs your action tiles (behind flag)', 'A doctor lands on the patient list and has no overview of today''s appointments or of what is waiting on them (results to interpret, patients not notified, missing consent, unconfirmed visits). The Panel (/dashboard) is admin-only.', '* Doctor Panel: tile ① Today (today''s + tomorrow''s own appointments) and tile ② Needs your action (own-patient queue), with the existing patient list below (D1).
