  VALUES ('NEO', 234, 'Recursos: video grid scrolls sideways on desktop', 'On desktop, the Recursos page with 4 video cards per row scrolls left and right. Each video card uses `margin: -6px` so its hover background can bleed out, which pushes the right column 6px past the content area. `.view-resources__window` has `overflow-y: auto`, so it scrolls sideways too.', 'Keep the hover bleed from adding horizontal overflow: clip the x-axis on the topics container, or replace the negative-margin trick, while the hover background still looks the same.',
