  VALUES ('NEO', 238, 'Doctor Panel v3: quick glance, ring top right, liquid-glass motion', 'Łukasz tested the doctor Panel ([NEO-233](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-233/doctor-panel-today-needs-your-action-tiles-behind-flag)) on dev. It is too long to be a quick glance, the stage ring sits at the bottom where nobody sees it, and the animations feel plain.', '* A short Panel: at most 3–4 rows per list, each list ending in a "see all" link.
