* Richer motion on a liquid-glass look: glass cards, staggered entrance, the ring drawing in with a glow, counters that count up, a hover lift. Everything respects reduced motion.
* Same data and endpoints as [NEO-233](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-233/doctor-panel-today-needs-your-action-tiles-behind-flag); no API change.',
    '* Lists show at most 4 rows plus "see all".
* The ring is in the top-right area on desktop and near the top on phone.
* Entrance and leave animations run (staggered), and are skipped with reduced motion.
