  VALUES ('NEO', 239, 'Doctor Panel: slower entrance, staggered count-up, skeleton, unclipped glow', 'On dev (after [NEO-238](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-238/doctor-panel-v3-quick-glance-ring-top-right-liquid-glass-motion)) the Panel''s motion mostly happens too early to see: it runs while the page transition is still playing. The numbers don''t visibly count up from 0, there is no skeleton while data loads, and the coloured backdrop and shadows are cut off in a box instead of reaching the edge of the white app card.', '* The entrance starts after the page transition and lasts longer; the ring takes about 1.6 s to spin in.
