  VALUES ('NEO', 243, 'Doctor Panel: stage ring hops right when it loads', 'On the doctor Panel, "Mis pacientes por etapa" ring jumps sideways for a moment as it loads. The shimmer skeleton ring is 150 px and centred in its own box, the real ring is 176 px and laid out by the donut''s flex rules, so at the handover the ring hops \~13 px right (measured in Chromium and WebKit). Zero-length segments also flash as stray dots before they draw.', '* Skeleton and donut share one slot (`.dp__ring-body`); the skeleton copies the donut''s geometry (176 px stage at its 0.8 start scale, same ring thickness, same legend flex rules).
* The ring no longer slides 6 px on reveal, it only fades in on the spot.
* Segments stay hidden (opacity 0) until they draw, so no round-cap dots.
* New e2e `doctor-panel-ring.spec.ts` + harness: skeleton ring and ring centres match at 1280 / 1000 / 390 px.',
    '* No sideways hop when the Panel loads on pwa-dev.
* e2e passes in Chromium and WebKit (fails on the old code with a 12.6 px offset).

Related: [NEO-239](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-239/doctor-panel-slower-entrance-staggered-count-up-skeleton-unclipped)', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
