  VALUES ('NEO', 245, 'Doctor''s Estudios and Tratamientos lists follow the care protocol', 'A doctor''s Estudios/Tratamientos lists showed the doctor in every row, always "Aparato dental", and a status ("Iniciado") that said neither which protocol visit the patient is at nor what comes next. The doctor had to open each record to find who needs them.', '* Queue chips: Requieren acción / En curso / (Seguimiento) / Finalizados, with counts; rows sorted by priority.
