    '* API + PWA specs green (clinicalQueues, useEntityList.queues, clinicalLists, clinicalProgress, AdvanceLevelField).
* On pwa-dev both lists load with chips, stages and next steps (verified 2026-10-05 after the API deploy of 69a93cb).
* No vendor names in the UI.', 'needs_review', 0, '{}'::text[],
