  VALUES ('NEO', 257, 'Historia Clínica PDF: long patient name overlaps date of birth', 'In the Historia Clínica PDF header every value has `white-space: nowrap`, so a long patient name (e.g. "Paciente Prueba [NEO-240](https://linear.app/neosleep/issue/NEO-240/atm-card-refreshes-after-saving-no-mini-skull-on-the-atm-tab)-phone-muu5vk65") runs over the Fecha de nacimiento and Edad columns.', '`packages/documents/templates/historiaEndo.html`: keep labels on one line, but let values wrap inside their own column (break long words only when they do not fit).',
    '* A long name wraps onto a second line inside the patient column, no overlap with date of birth / age.
* Short values (dates, age) still render on one line.
* Before/after shown in the Artifact.', 'done', 0, '{}'::text[],
